@startuml AdapterSequence
title Sequence Diagram - Adapter Pattern (Phiên dịch SDK bên thứ ba)

actor Client as "OrderCheckoutService\n(Client)"
participant Adapter as "VNPayPaymentAdapter\n(Adapter)"
participant Sdk as "ExternalVNPaySdk\n(Adaptee)"

Client -> Adapter : processPayment(amount, orderId)
activate Adapter
note right of Adapter
  Chuyển đổi giao diện chuẩn hệ thống
  sang định dạng riêng của VNPay SDK.
end note
Adapter -> Adapter : map tham số\n(vnp_Amount = amount * 100,\n vnp_TxnRef = orderId)
Adapter -> Sdk : doPaymentGateway(vnpParams)
activate Sdk
Sdk --> Adapter : { code, vnp_TransactionNo, message }
deactivate Sdk
Adapter -> Adapter : isSuccess = (code === '00')
Adapter -> Adapter : map kết quả về PaymentResult
Adapter --> Client : PaymentResult (chuẩn IPaymentProcessor)
deactivate Adapter

@enduml
